            "review_title": "Review at Cơm tấm Chị Hằng since 1993",
            "review_text": "Gumayusi\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nGood food!\nDec 2024 • Friends\nI’m really impressed with the quality of food here. The rice is soft, the pork is tasty, and the service is excellent. I will visit the restaurant again to try more of its amazing dishes.\nInsider tip:\nEveryone should come and try the broken rice here. It definitely won't disappoint you.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 23, 2024",
