            "review_text": "Thảo P\n1 contribution\n0\nA must-try for Vietnamese food lovers!\nDec 2024 • Solo\nThe broken rice here is delicious and authentic. The rice is soft and slightly chewy, paired perfectly with tender, flavorful grilled pork. The pickled vegetables and savory fish sauce add the perfect balance. A must-try for Vietnamese food lovers!\nInsider tip:\nLet's eat rib rice\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 23, 2024",
